WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Football is emotion.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.280
It comes from the heart.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.640
It crosses all barriers.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.040
You play football anywhere.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.360
This is an amateur football country.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.280
Going to the World Cup was unthinkable,

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.640
but these guys they have something in them.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.040
The real excitement about football,
isn't always the best team that wins the game.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:30.800
Lionel Messi,

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.200
he was not the tallest, not the strongest,

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.480
nobody could imagine that

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.080
he would be the best player
of the history of the football.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.800
No way, that's genius!

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.040
This love,

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:10.280
this involvement of the whole country,

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.440
it comes from your guts.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.440
It's not only about sports.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.280
it's shown us what we can do

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.520
when we work together.

